-shows-loading-indefinitely","content":"Picker shows \"Loading...\" indefinitely"},"5986":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-35","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/cbac-picker#no-markings-appear","content":"No markings appear"},"5987":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-36","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/cbac-picker#banner-shows-default-colors","content":"Banner shows default colors"},"5988":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-37","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/cbac-picker#validation-errors-selected-markings-do-not-include-all-required-markings","content":"Validation errors: \"Selected markings do not include all required markings\""},"5989":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-38","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/cbac-picker#css-not-applied","content":"CSS not applied"},"5990":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-39","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/cbac-picker#type-errors-with-imports","content":"Type errors with imports"},"5991":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-40","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/cbac-picker#additional-resources","content":"Additional Resources"},"5992":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-41","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker","content":"CBAC markings control who can access data. Each piece of data can carry markings from different categories, and the combination determines its access restrictions."},"5993":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-42","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker","content":"The picker lets users select markings grouped by category. Some categories are **disjunctive** (pick exactly one, like a sensitivity level) and others are **conjunctive** (pick any combination, like access groups). The server enforces which combinations are valid, which markings are implied by others, and which are disallowed."},"5994":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-43","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#prerequisites","content":"Before using CBAC components, make sure you have completed the library setup described in Prerequisites, including:"},"5995":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-44","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#prerequisites","content":"Installing the required dependencies"},"5996":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-45","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#prerequisites","content":"Wrapping your app with `OsdkProvider`"},"5997":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-46","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#prerequisites","content":"Adding the CSS imports"},"5998":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-47","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#inline-picker","content":"The simplest way to use the CBAC picker is inline with `CbacPicker`:"},"5999":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-48","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#inline-picker","content":"This renders a marking picker that fetches CBAC categories and markings via the OSDK, displays them grouped by category, and shows a classification banner. The server enforces marking restrictions automatically — the picker reflects which markings are implied, disallowed, or required based on the current selection."},"6000":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-49","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#picker-in-a-dialog","content":"For modal workflows, use `CbacPickerDialog`:"},"6001":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-50","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags"