c-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#cbacpickerdialog","content":"| Prop        | Type                             | Required | Default | Description                                     |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------- | -------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `onConfirm` | `(markingIds: string[]) => void` | Yes      | -       | Called with the selected marking IDs on confirm |","table":"table-1"},"6010":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-59","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#cbacpickerdialog","content":"| Prop                | Type       | Required | Default | Description                         |\n| ------------------- | ---------- | -------- | ------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `initialMarkingIds` | `string[]` | No       | `[]`    | Initial set of selected marking IDs |","table":"table-1"},"6011":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-60","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#cbacpickerdialog","content":"| Prop             | Type      | Required | Default | Description                                               |\n| ---------------- | --------- | -------- | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `includeDeleted` | `boolean` | No       | `true`  | Whether deleted markings and marking categories are shown |","table":"table-1"},"6012":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-61","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#cbacpickerdialog","content":"The dialog title automatically adjusts: \"Add classification\" when no initial markings are provided, \"Edit classification\" when editing existing markings. The confirm button is disabled with a tooltip when the selection is invalid (e.g., missing required markings)."},"6013":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-62","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#cbacbanner","content":"Fetches banner data for the given marking IDs and renders the resolved classification banner."},"6014":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-63","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#cbacbanner","content":"| Prop         | Type       | Required | Default | Description                                         |\n| ------------ | ---------- | -------- | ------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `markingIds` | `string[]` | Yes      | -       | Marking IDs to resolve into a classification banner |","table":"table-2"},"6015":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-64","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#cbacbanner","content":"| Prop      | Type         | Required | Default | Description                |\n| --------- | ------------ | -------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `onClick` | `() => void` | No       | -       | Makes the banner clickable |","table":"table-2"},"6016":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-65","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#cbacbanner","content":"| Prop        | Type         | Required | Default | Description            |\n| ----------- | ------------ | -------- | ------- | ---------------------- |\n| `onDismiss` | `() => void` | No       | -       | Shows a dismiss button |","table":"table-2"},"6017":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-66","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#cbacbanner","content":"| Prop        | Type      | Required | Default | Description                                                                                                                                        |\n| ----------- | --------- | -------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------