ion (its `key`, or its link and property names) |","table":"table-4"},"6247":{"id":"/components/filter-list-94","page_id":"/components/filter-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/filter-list#keyword-search-filter-definition","content":"| Name        | Type      | Description                                                                                                                |\n| ----------- | --------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `isVisible` | `boolean` | Controls whether this filter is rendered. When false, the filter is hidden but its state is preserved. Defaults to `true`. |","table":"table-4"},"6248":{"id":"/components/filter-list-95","page_id":"/components/filter-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/filter-list#keyword-search-filter-definition","content":"| Name   | Type               | Description   |\n| ------ | ------------------ | ------------- |\n| `type` | `\"KEYWORD_SEARCH\"` | **Required.** |","table":"table-4"},"6249":{"id":"/components/filter-list-96","page_id":"/components/filter-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/filter-list#keyword-search-filter-definition","content":"| Name         | Type           | Description                                                                                                              |\n| ------------ | -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `properties` | `\"all\" \\| K[]` | **Required.** Properties to search within - \"all\": Search all string properties - K[]: Search specific string properties |","table":"table-4"},"6250":{"id":"/components/filter-list-97","page_id":"/components/filter-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/filter-list#keyword-search-filter-definition","content":"| Name    | Type     | Description |\n| ------- | -------- | ----------