:"/components/prerequisites#without-tailwind","content":"Without Tailwind"},"6949":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-7","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/prerequisites#with-tailwind-css-v4","content":"With Tailwind CSS v4"},"6950":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-8","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/prerequisites#custom-theme-overrides","content":"Custom theme overrides"},"6951":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-9","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/prerequisites#token-scopes","content":"Token scopes"},"6952":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-10","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/prerequisites#light-and-dark-mode","content":"Light and dark mode"},"6953":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-11","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/prerequisites#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"6954":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-12","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#install-dependencies","content":"[!TIP]\nIf your tooling already installs dependencies, skip this step."},"6955":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-13","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#install-dependencies","content":"Use whichever package manager your project uses:"},"6956":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-14","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#configure-the-osdk-client","content":"Create an OSDK client with a `createPublicOauthClient` token provider and wrap your app with `OsdkProvider`. Use the client ID and redirect URL from your application's OAuth settings in Developer Console:"},"6957":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-15","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#configure-the-osdk-client","content":"All component packages require an `OsdkProvider` wrapping your app. Without it, data fetching hooks will throw."},"6958":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-16","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#important-portal-isolation-required","content":"Components use Base UI portals, which require stacking context isolation:"},"6959":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-17","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#important-portal-isolation-required","content":"Apply this to your root element. See the Base UI docs for details."},"6960":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-18","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#layers","content":"Import the component styles into a CSS `@layer` in your application's entry CSS file (e.g., `index.css`). Using a layer keeps the cascade predictable: later layers always win when styles conflict, regardless of selector specificity, so your own styles and theme overrides take precedence over the defaults."},"6961":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-19","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#layers","content":"The examples below import the styles into a layer named `osdk.components`; declare any of your own layers after it to override."},"6962":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-20","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#custom-theme-overrides","content":"Add a custom layer after the OSDK layers to override any token:"},"6963":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-21","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#token-scopes","content":"All components resolve their visual properties through CSS custom properties. There are two scopes of tokens you can target when theming:"},"6964":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-22","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#token-scopes","content":"**OSDK tokens (`--osdk-*`)** — every visual property used inside OSDK components resolves through a token prefixed with `--osdk-` (e.g. `--osdk-table-header-bg`, `--osdk-form-section-content-padding-inline`). Override these to theme **OSDK components only**, leaving other Blueprint components in your app untouched."},"6965":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-23","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#token-scopes","content":"**Blueprint tokens (`--bp-*`)** — the underlying Blueprint design tokens that most `--osdk-*` tokens map to. Override these for consistent theming across **both Blueprint and OSDK components**. (A few `--osdk-*` tokens hold raw values rather than mapping to a `--bp-*` token — override those `--osdk-*` tokens directly.)"},"6966":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-24","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#token-scopes","content":"Per-component references list the `--osdk-*` variables each component exposes — see, for example, ObjectTable › Theming. The full catalog of variables lives in CSSVariables.md."},"6967":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-25","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#light-and-dark-mode","content":"OSDK components ship a built-in dark theme. Wrap your app in `<OsdkThemeProvider>` to activate it and to let users override the OS preference at runtime:"},"6968":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-26","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#light-and-dark-mode","content":"By default the provider follows `prefers-color-scheme` and writes the resolved value to `data-bp-color-scheme` on `<html>` — matching Blueprint's convention so the theme also applies to portaled overlays (popovers, dialogs, tooltips)."},"6969":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-27","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#light-and-dark-mode","content":"See OsdkThemeProvider for the full reference, including the `defaultTheme` modes, the `useOsdkTheme` hook, persisting the user's choice, and integrating with an external theme store via controlled mode."},"6970":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-28","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#accessibility","content":"When overriding theme tokens, keep the result accessible:"},"6971":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-29","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#accessibility","content":"**Color contrast (WCAG AA):** 4.5:1 for normal text, 3:1 for large text."},"6972":{"id":"/components/prerequisites-30","page_id":"/components/prerequisites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/prerequisites#accessibility","content":"**Distinct interactive states:** rest, hover, active, selected, and focused should each be visually distinguishable — the default `--osdk-table-row-bg-*` and `--osdk-table-row-border-color-*` tokens are designed to meet WCAG AA; preserve that intent in custom themes."},"6973":{"id":"/components/spreadsheet-viewer","page_id":"/components/spreadsheet-viewer","type":"page","content":"SpreadsheetViewer","breadcrumbs":["OSDK TypeScript","Components","Media"],"tags":[],"url":"/components/spreadsheet-viewer"},"6974":{"id":"/components/spreadsheet-viewer-0","page_id":"/components/spreadsheet-viewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/spreadsheet-viewer","content":"SpreadsheetViewer renders an .xlsx spreadsheet as styled HTML tables with a tab for each sheet."},"6975":{"id":"/components/spreadsheet-viewer-1","page_id":"/components/spreadsheet-viewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/spreadsheet-viewer#import","content":"Impo