page_id":"/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components#experimental","content":"| Component        | Import path                                           | Description              |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `WorkshopModule` | `@osdk/react-components/experimental/workshop-module` | Embeds a Workshop module |","table":"table-1"},"7103":{"id":"/components-23","page_id":"/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components#quick-start","content":"Components need an `OsdkProvider` above them and the package styles imported into a CSS layer. See Prerequisites for the full setup."},"7104":{"id":"/components/workshop-module","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","type":"page","content":"WorkshopModule","breadcrumbs":["OSDK TypeScript","Components","Experimental"],"tags":[],"url":"/components/workshop-module"},"7105":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-0","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module","content":"Renders a Workshop module in an iframe using the Foundry URL from your OsdkProvider client. This experimental component accepts a module RID and version and uses Workshop's embedded view."},"7106":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-1","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/workshop-module#import","content":"Import"},"7107":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-2","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/workshop-module#usage","content":"Usage"},"7108":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-3","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/workshop-module#branch","content":"Branch"},"7109":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-4","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/workshop-module#theme","content":"Theme"},"7110":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-5","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/workshop-module#without-osdkprovider","content":"Without OsdkProvider"},"7111":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-6","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/workshop-module#props","content":"Props"},"7112":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-7","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/workshop-module#workshopmoduleprops","content":"WorkshopModuleProps"},"7113":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-8","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/workshop-module#baseworkshopmoduleprops","content":"BaseWorkshopModuleProps"},"7114":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-9","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#usage","content":"Render inside an existing `OsdkProvider` and give the container a height. Import the component stylesheet as described in the Prerequisites."},"7115":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-10","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#usage","content":"`moduleVersion` defaults to `published` and accepts only `latest` or `published`. Use `latest` for the latest saved version, or `published` for the published version (falling back to the latest saved version if none is published). Changing the RID or version navigates the iframe to the new module or version."},"7116":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-11","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#usage","content":"The iframe uses the user's browser session to authenticate with Foundry. The user must have access to the module, and the Foundry deployment must permit embedding from the app's origin. The component does not forward the OSDK client's access token into the iframe."},"7117":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-12","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#usage","content":"This component renders the module only. It does not map interface variables or establish a message channel."},"7118":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-13","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#branch","content":"`WorkshopModule` inherits the resolved global branch from the client in `OsdkProvider`, so the embedded module uses the same branch as the app's OSDK requests. Replacing the provider's client with one on a different branch navigates the iframe and resets the module's state."},"7119":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-14","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#branch","content":"`BaseWorkshopModule` accepts an explicit `branchRid`. When no branch is supplied, it opens on main, including when Workshop previously remembered another branch in the browser session."},"7120":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-15","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#branch","content":"Version selection keeps Workshop's existing behavior: on a branch, both `published` and `latest` load the latest saved module on that branch, falling back to the latest saved module on main if needed. On main, `moduleVersion` selects the published or latest saved version as described above."},"7121":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-16","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#theme","content":"`WorkshopModule` inherits the initial theme from the nearest OsdkThemeProvider. The provider is optional; without one, Workshop uses the module's theme. In `system` mode, the iframe stays hidden with no URL until the browser preference is resolved. It starts loading only after the initial light or dark theme is known."},"7122":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-17","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#theme","content":"The theme is captured once per mount. Later provider changes do not reload the iframe or reset the module's state. Remount the component to apply a different theme. A Workshop module with a variable-driven theme keeps its own theme behavior."},"7123":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-18","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#theme","content":"For `BaseWorkshopModule`, pass `defaultTheme=\"light\"`, `defaultTheme=\"dark\"`, or `defaultTheme=\"system\"` explicitly. It does not read `OsdkThemeProvider`."},"7124":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-19","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#without-osdkprovider","content":"Use `BaseWorkshopModule` to supply the Foundry URL explicitly:"},"7125":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-20","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#workshopmoduleprops","content":"| Name        | Type     | Description                                         |\n| ----------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `moduleRid` | `string` | **Required.** RID of the Workshop module to render. |","table":"table-0"},"7126":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-21","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#workshopmoduleprops","content":"| Name            | Type                      | Description                                                                                                                                                                                 |\n| --------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `moduleVersion` | `\"latest\" \\| \"published\"` | Module version: `latest` for the latest saved version, or `published` for the published version (falling back to the latest saved version if none is published). Defaults to `\"published\"`. |","table":"table-0"},"7127":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-22","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#workshopmoduleprops","content":"| Name    | Type     | Description                                                       |\n| ------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `title` | `string` | Accessible title for the iframe. Defaults to `\"Workshop module\"`. |","table":"table-0"},"7128":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-23","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#workshopmoduleprops","content":"| Name        | Type     | Description                                                        |\n| ----------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `className` | `string` | Additional CSS class name for the iframe. Defaults to `undefined`. |","table":"table-0"},"7129":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-24","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#workshopmoduleprops","content":"| Name    | Type            | Description                                                                                |\n| ------- | --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `style` | `CSSProperties` | Inline styles for the iframe. By default, it fills its container. Defaults to `undefined`. |","table":"table-0"},"7130":{"id":"/components/workshop-module-25","page_id":"/components/workshop-module","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#baseworkshopmoduleprops","co