],"type":"text","url":"/components/workshop-module#baseworkshopmoduleprops","content":"| Name           | Type                            | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                               |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `defaultTheme` | `\"light\" \\| \"dark\" \\| \"system\"` | Sets the initial theme. `system` reads the browser's preference once before the module loads.<br /><br />Changes after mount are ignored. Remount to change the theme. Defaults to `undefined (uses the module's theme)`. |","table":"table-1"},"7138":{"id":"/components/xml-viewer","page_id":"/components/xml-viewer","type":"page","content":"XmlViewer","breadcrumbs":["OSDK TypeScript","Components","Media"],"tags":[],"url":"/components/xml-viewer"},"7139":{"id":"/components/xml-viewer-0","page_id":"/components/xml-viewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/xml-viewer","content":"XmlViewer displays XML from an OSDK Media object, or a string you provide, in a styled monospace <pre><code> block."},"7140":{"id":"/components/xml-viewer-1","page_id":"/components/xml-viewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/xml-viewer#import","content":"Import"},"7141":{"id":"/components/xml-viewer-2","page_id":"/components/xml-viewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/xml-viewer#usage","content":"Usage"},"7142":{"id":"/components/xml-viewer-3","page_id":"/components/xml-viewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/components/xml-viewer#with-osdk-media","content":"With OSDK Media"},"7143":{"id":"/components/xml-viewer-4","page_id":"/components/xml-viewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"