er` takes precedence in the table header, but `columnName` is still used in other places where the column name is displayed (e.g., the column configuration dialog, multi-sort dialog)."],[6987,"**`SpreadsheetViewer`** — Primary component for OSDK usage. Accepts an OSDK `Media` object, parses the spreadsheet, and renders it."],[7042,"**`TiffViewer`** — Primary component for OSDK usage. Accepts an OSDK `Media` object, handles fetching the TIFF contents, and renders via `BaseTiffViewer`."],[245,"**`useObjectSet`.** When the object set changes, `data` keeps the last loaded result until the new set loads."],[246,"**`useOsdkFunction`.** `isLoading` is `true` only while a request is in flight, so the first render can report `isLoading: false` with no data. Treat `data === undefined && error == null` as the initial state, or check `lastUpdated === 0`."],[247,"**`useOsdkMetadata`.** It uses `loading`, not `isLoading`, and `error` is the error's message as a string, not an `Error`. It does not retry after a failure."],[244,"**`useOsdkObject`.** `isLoading` is `false` as soon as `error` is set."],[7066,"**`VideoViewer`** — Primary component for OSDK usage. Accepts an OSDK `Media` object, handles fetching the video contents, and renders with native browser controls."],[7148,"**`XmlViewer`** — Primary component for OSDK usage. Accepts an OSDK `Media` object, fetches the XML text, and renders it."],[1324,"**A `tsconfig.json` in `.osdk`.** After generating, the plugin runs `tsc` with `.osdk` as the working directory and fails if it exits with an error."],[2804,"**Actions applied with `useOsdkAction`.** The server reports which objects the action added, modified, and deleted. The cache refetches those objects, and every list, link, aggregation, and function that depends on their types re-evaluates."],[1605,"**Allow the origin.** Ask your Foundry administrator to allow `http://localhost:8080` for CORS on your environment."],[6070,"**Banner data** — the classification string, text color, and background colors"],[6074,"**Base layer** (`BaseCbacPicker`, `BaseCbacBanner`, `BaseCbacPickerDialog`) — pure UI with no OSDK dependency, accepts primitive data directly"],[4940,"**Blueprint Token Mappings**: OSDK-namespaced aliases to Blueprint's design tokens"],[6965,"**Blueprint tokens (`--bp-*`)** — the underlying Blueprint design tokens that most `--osdk-*` tokens map to. Override these for consistent theming across **both Blueprint and OSDK components**. (A few `--osdk-*` tokens hold raw values rather than mapping to a `--bp-*` token — override those `--osdk-*` tokens directly.)"],[6407,"**Bold**, _italic_, and ~~strikethrough~~ text"],[6901,"**Building block components** — Assemble a custom layout using `PdfViewerContent`, `PdfViewerToolbar`, etc."],[6625,"**Bulk Submission**:"],[1611,"**Callback route.** Your app renders a route at the redirect path, so the OAuth client can complete sign-in."],[2879,"**Clear logs**, in the same menu, empties the feed. It does not reset the other devtools metrics."],[1609,"**Client ID.** The client ID passed to `createPublicOauthClient` matches the one on your application's **OAuth & scopes** page in Developer Console."],[6971,"**Color contrast (WCAG AA):** 4.5:1 for normal text, 3:1 for large text."],[1077,"**Compile.** The `maker` CLI imports that file and writes the IR to `ontology.json`, plus `value-types.json` when you define value types."],[2924,"**Components.** The injected Fiber hook attributes each `@osdk/react` hook to the component that mounted it. The hook must install before React loads. If React loads first, the panel still works but shows a **DevTools Hook Not Installed** notice and component attribution is limited."],[6900,"**Components** (`PdfViewer` / `BasePdfViewer`) — Drop-in viewers with full UI out of the box."],[6059,"**Conjunctive** categories: adds or removes the marking (checkbox behavior)"],[2925,"**Console.** The monitor captures `console` calls from page load, whether the panel is open or 