[2308,"| Endpoint returns   | The function resolves to                         |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| No content (`204`) | `undefined`. The return type is `Promise<void>`. |"],[2309,"| Endpoint returns | The function resolves to                                                         |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Binary content   | The `Response`. Read it with `.blob()`, `.arrayBuffer()`, `.text()`, or `.body`. |"],[2307,"| Endpoint returns | The function resolves to                                        |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| JSON             | The parsed body, typed, such as `User` or `ListGroupsResponse`. |"],[1852,"| Error                                                                             | Cause                                                                                                                                         |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Foundry serves widget files from the root path, so Vite's base must be \"/\". ...` | Vite's `base` is set to anything other than `/`, such as `./` or `/widgets/`. Remove `base` or set it to `/`. Developer mode is not affected. |"],[1011,"| Error                                                                             | Cause                                                                                                                            | Fix                                                                                 |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `\"<name>\" is not exported by @osdk/client/.../observable.js` (or `@osdk/api/...`) | `@osdk/client` or `@osdk/api` is on a different release line than `@osdk/react`, often a prerelease paired with stable versions. | Install the exact `@osdk/client` and `@osdk/api` versions that match `@osdk/react`. |"],[4328,"| Error                                                                | Cause                                                                   |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Cannot filter on property \"<name>\" with an undefined or null value` | A `where` clause had a `null` or `undefined` value. See Filter objects. |"],[4329,"| Error                                                              | Cause                                                        |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `A WhereClause Filter with multiple clauses/fields is not allowed` | One property in a `where` clause had more than one operator. |"],[1856,"| Error                                                          | Cause                                                         |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Invalid script type attribute found in Vite HTML output: ...` | A `<script>` `type` other than `module` or `text/javascript`. |"],[1012,"| Error                                                      | Cause                                                                                                                                                    | Fix                                                        |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| npm or pnpm peer warning for `@osdk/client` or `@osdk/api` | The declared peer ranges allow newer `@osdk/client` and `@osdk/api` releases than `@osdk/react` was built with, and, since `2.87.0`, warn on older ones. | Pin the matching versions instead of ignoring the warning. |"],[1849,"| Error                                                   | Cause                                                             |\n| ------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Multiple widget config files found for entrypoint ...` | The entrypoint's bundle includes more than one `*.config` module. |"],[1854,"| Error                                                 | Cause                                                                                      |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Unexpected inline content found in Vite HTML output` | The built HTML has an inline `<script>` or `<link>` with content. Load scripts with `src`. |"],[1855,"| Error                                                | Cause                                                                                                                                                         |\n| ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Unexpected ... attribute found in Vite HTML output` | A `<script>` has attributes other than `src`, `type`, and `crossorigin`, or a stylesheet `<link>` has attributes other than `rel`, `href`, and `crossorigin`. |"],[1857,"| Error                                             | Cause                                                     |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `The version string ... is not SemVer compliant.` | The computed version is not valid SemVer. See Versioning. |"],[1848,"| Error                                             | Cause                                               |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `No widget config files found for entrypoint ...` | The entrypoint does not import a `*.config` module. |"],[1853,"| Error                                            | Cause                                                                                                                            |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Entrypoint chunk not found for input file: ...` | The built HTML's script paths do not match a bundle entry chunk, for example when an entry `<script>` points outside the bundle. |"],[4330,"| Error                                          | Cause                                                                                  |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Object does not implement interface '<name>'` | `$as` was called with an interface the object type does not implement. See Interfaces. |"],[1847,"| Error                                 | Cause                                                            |\n| ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `foundry.config.json file not found.` | No `foundry.config.json` in the working directory or any parent. |"],[1850,"| Error                            | Cause                                  |\n| -------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `No default export found in ...` | The config file has no default export. |"],[1851,"| Error                      | Cause                      |\n| -------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `Duplicate widget ID: ...` | Two configs share an `id`. |"],[4327,"| Error                     | Cause                                                                                      |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `baseUrl cannot be empty` | `createClient` got an empty base URL. A malformed URL throws a `TypeError` from `new URL`. |"],[4302,"| Error                   | Import         | Thrown when                                              |\n| ----------------------- | -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `ActionValidationError` | `@osdk/client` | `applyAction` ran the action's validation and it failed. |"],[4326,"| Error                  | Cause                                                                                                                                                                              |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Invalid ontology RID` | `createClient` got an Ontology RID string that does not start with `ri.`. If you pass a `Promise`, the check runs when it resolves and surfaces as an unhandled rejection instead. |"],[4301,"| Error              | Import         | Thrown when                                                       