tType`, `interface`, and `struct` render as disabled unsupported fields by default. | Override those parameters with `fieldComponent: \"CUSTOM\"` or another compatible component in `formFieldDefinitions`. |"],[4736,"| Feature                         | Current behavior                                                                                                                                                                                              | Workaround                                                                                               |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Action-authored layout metadata | Action-defined sections, form content ordering, section validation, and layout toggles are not read from metadata. Fields render in metadata parameter order unless fully replaced by `formFieldDefinitions`. | Group fields with `formContentDefinitions` sections, or control field order with `formFieldDefinitions`. |"],[4734,"| Feature                   | Current behavior                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | Workaround                                                                                                                                                               |\n| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Backend action validation | When `onSubmit` is omitted, the form validates the action with Foundry 500 ms after each field change and again before submit. If the result is `INVALID`, the action is not applied, and failed submission criteria and parameter errors are listed in the footer. Validation-derived displays, allowed values, defaults, and section results are not processed. With `onSubmit`, no backend validation runs. | Read the full response with `onValidationResponse`. Use `formFieldDefinitions` validation props, field-level `validate`, `onSubmit`, and `onError` for app-owned checks. |"],[4738,"| Feature               | Current behavior                                                                                                                        | Workaround                                                                                                                  |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Defaults and prefills | Backend prefills, type-class defaults, current timestamp defaults, and validation-derived default values are not applied automatically. | Provide `defaultValue` in field definitions, seed controlled `formState`, or compute defaults in app code before rendering. |"],[4202,"| Field               